{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8b0ac6e75a3a0a23f2680a041b5a7bcc3d04ff13e9f8333d6ef270096857f076", "ja": "（今日は、紬のファンイベント。\n集まったファン達に、紬はチョコの手渡しをした）", "zh": "（今天是紬的粉丝活动。\n紬向到场的粉丝们亲手递上了巧克力。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0f97fa163f76f502f7dc9e591e3536c02bf5032b417c22605bbe54b13b79a79f", "ja": "お疲れさま、紬。トラブルもなくてよかったよ。\nみんな、すごく喜んでくれたな。", "zh": "辛苦了，紬。还好没有发生什么问题。\n大家都非常开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e2edf4bec03b05488a36717820894df50071043c7c8a13e7bf741c04dfe2ebc8", "ja": "はい。ファンの方々には、日頃の感謝をお伝えした\nつもりですが……好評なようで、私も嬉しいです。", "zh": "是的。我本想向各位粉丝表达平日里的感谢……看来大家都很喜欢，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc7c2b5bdcbea6ec66b5989206e3809b21bd5824f95afe002694e08199682627", "ja": "ただ、その……。\n皆さん、少々、喜びすぎだった気がするのですが。", "zh": "不过，那个……\n我只是觉得，大家好像有点高兴过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1004_p", "source_sha256": "78228bde0f45e2759d353ad7dcc33557d2f219938340fd9b90d78db338aeb0c8", "ja": "そりゃ、嬉しいもんだよ。\n紬のファンなら、みんなそうだろうな。", "zh": "那当然会开心了。\n如果是紬的粉丝，大家应该都会这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "80b69c6601edcf3ec3c0300b8b3ab3361bf9ad4fbc257355dc6f9894091c8fd3", "ja": "そう、ですか……。\nでしたら、あの……貴方も、そうなのですか？", "zh": "这样啊……  \n那么，那个……您也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6ad17f4db5107980892beca74f6d0696ca7e43aaec4c07a5880da57f83e92c00", "ja": "もちろん。この前チョコをくれたとき、嬉しかったよ。\nしっかり感想を言えなくて、悪かったけど。", "zh": "当然了。之前收到你的巧克力时，我很开心哦。\n虽然很抱歉当时没能好好告诉你我的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "997b9e939940cda4a8bbc753c09d63501ac216be9897ca0667948d0014aca72e", "ja": "はあ……。いえ、大丈夫です。\n仕事の合間でしたし。", "zh": "唉……没事的。毕竟是在工作间隙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d38919f6d5264bb49367f50350c8cc2ec509774cccef7ece43d5882ea1b9445d", "ja": "むしろ、面と向かって詳細な感想を言われては、\nこちらも気まずいものです。……いささか無神経では？", "zh": "倒不如说，面对面被人详细地说感想，我这边也会觉得尴尬。……是不是有点不太体贴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1009_p", "source_sha256": "288f6a99b3c287c58873420f1d7d64fee8c358d1f866f155461d3bf5904de894", "ja": "あ、ああ、ごめん……にしてもアレ、かなり\n本格的だったよな。作るの手間だったんじゃないか？", "zh": "啊、啊，对不起……不过那个，做得相当有模有样呢。制作起来很费工夫吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "70264f027117065f9b2df7b0c8a91fa1afdef2cfd4087ae41ac2288b91826533", "ja": "まあ、それなりには……。\nい、いえ。どうしてあれが、私の手作りだと……？", "zh": "还算挺费事的吧……\n不、不对。您怎么会知道那是……我亲手做的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1011_p", "source_sha256": "38d132f1e162725d4d34d0cbe8e63729b6637a12686e9f798d61dd3419cd8099", "ja": "え？　だって紬、\nこの前、チョコのレシピ本を読んでたから。", "zh": "咦？因为紬你之前在看巧克力食谱书啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "57b073cfe9375f3a598c8cabeb267ca69370ed14cfdf3b310d11eba6dc90b8e9", "ja": "っ！　やはり、気づいていたのですね……。\nあの場で貴方と出会ったことは、一生の不覚です！", "zh": "呃！果然还是被你发现了……  \n在那种地方遇见你，真是我一生的失策！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "60adbb37981fc0b5285295e602e4d5a67e6d9654277d96e9df74a641ac3fb53c", "ja": "あんな偶然があるなんて……。\nはっ、まさか……私の後をつけて……？", "zh": "居然会有那种巧合……  \n啊，难道说……你一直跟踪我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d1d701347f3750dcfa11f586cd2c35f7e1ac3e53b436448ea0835c30b3a2e8b4", "ja": "い、いや、違うって！　たまたま通りかかったんだよ。\n気づかないふりをするのも変だし。", "zh": "不、不是那样！只是碰巧路过而已。\n装作没注意到也很奇怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "484f6627fbca87bd0ab7405dce2d5e32364bd051b107edf5a4500252cc1c9640", "ja": "はあ……それでも、不覚です。\nチョコの準備は、内密に進めるつもりだったのに。", "zh": "唉……即便如此，还是大意了。\n本来打算偷偷准备巧克力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4e7f793d79a339b9440f58c5258c552718af2abc9c8bc864a06e7feb3d13b9ce", "ja": "紬……そうか。\nなんて言うか……すごく真剣だったんだな。", "zh": "紬……这样啊。该怎么说呢……你真的很认真啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "933b616c0de6059107bdafe8f0ceae18d57a8da9d98d79d955039582571731b4", "ja": "……。当然です。何事も気持ちを込めようと思えば、\nいい加減な心構えでは挑めませんから。", "zh": "……这是当然的。无论做什么事，只要打算倾注心意，\n就绝不能以敷衍的心态去面对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "633e9d4b4870ad114dc5c70998e806422fd896ab04494a42f4996f55596b9d25", "ja": "……。\nわかりますか？", "zh": "……。\n你明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1019_p", "source_sha256": "894ae3d780533cc1f8e5d65e8b3fabad1d8bb6ba6983720bd78c4cd6bf1bc0a3", "ja": "ああ……紬の気持ちは、ちゃんと伝わったよ。\nありがとう。ファンのみんなにも伝わるといいな！", "zh": "啊……紬的心意，我确实感受到了。\n谢谢你。希望粉丝们也都能感受到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "585135a3f5b3092e3979cb8256689e25c8efcc1f2930bcc7603da10d164bc89d", "ja": "……。貴方という人は、まったく。", "zh": "……。你这个人，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0184_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4efbad025135d912efd75c218a89f47043d8ef0f5abd94c289e54c2d0d2f77c9", "ja": "だけど……ふふ、そうですね。\nもし伝わっていたなら……嬉しく思います。", "zh": "但是……呵呵，确实是这样呢。\n如果已经传达到了……我会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
